ass=\"update-badge release\">release</span>\n                    <a href=\"https://github.com/paul-gauthier/aider/releases\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\">Aider v0.86.0 - GPT-5 Support</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item-description\">\n                    Added support for all GPT-5 models, Grok-4, and new Gemini models. Enhanced user feedback with /clear confirmation messages and improved /undo output display.\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                    <span>2026-08-09</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"item\">\n                <div class=\"item-title\">\n                    <span class=\"update-badge release\">release</span>\n                    <a href=\"https://geminicli.com/docs/changelogs/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\">Gemini CLI v0.54.0 - Security Enhancements</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item-description\">\n                    Integrated Antigravity agent runner with Firestore concurrency controls, enhanced caretaker triage, strengthened HTTPS credential enforcement, and added ReAct/prompt injection loop prevention.\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                    <span>2026-08-06</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"item\">\n                <div class=\"item-title\">\n                    <span class=\"update-badge feature\">feature</span>\n                    <a href=\"https://cursor.com/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\">Cursor - Google Workspace Plugins</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item-description\">\n                    New integration with Google Workspace ecosystem, expanding Cursor's productivity capabilities for users.\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                    <span>2026-08-03</span>\n                </div>\n        